description:
This is a white nursing scrub dress and it is perfect for many different occasions. The best part is that it has pockets. Overall, this is a great outfit to wear to a pinning ceremony, as a Halloween costume, or even on the floor helping patients.  The fabric is a beautiful POLYESTER with about 5% of SPANDEX for stretch. There is a gorgeous bow in the back for adjustment of the dress and to cinch it at the waist. 

The sizes are listed as below:

XS (0–2): Bust 32&quot;–34&quot;, Waist 24&quot;–26&quot;, Hips 34&quot;–36&quot;
S (2–4): Bust 34&quot;–36&quot;, Waist 26&quot;–28&quot;, Hips 36&quot;–38&quot;
M (6–8): Bust 36&quot;–38&quot;, Waist 28&quot;–30&quot;, Hips 38&quot;–40&quot;
L (10–12): Bust 38&quot;–40&quot;, Waist 30&quot;–32&quot;, Hips 40&quot;–42&quot;
XL (14–16): Bust 40&quot;–42&quot;, Waist 32&quot;–34&quot;, Hips 42&quot;–44&quot;
2X (18–20): Bust 42&quot;–44&quot;, Waist 34&quot;–36&quot;, Hips 44&quot;–46&quot;
3X (22–24): Bust 46&quot;–48&quot;, Waist 38&quot;–40&quot;, Hips 48&quot;–50&quot;

The model in the photo is wearing a XS and is 5’3” weighing 110 lbs; Bust Size - 32 C. 

P.S. if you are wearing this to pinning ceremony I guarantee you all of your friends will love this dress and wish they wore it (I know this from experience). If you have any questions or concerns please feel free to reach out and ask at any time. Have a great day!

