Natural softness meets smart design – this Merino wool nightgown is made especially for maternity and nursing moms.

With its gentle V-neck crossover design, this nightdress allows easy breastfeeding access while maintaining full comfort during and after pregnancy. Whether you&#39;re expecting or already caring for your little one, this sleepwear wraps you in breathable warmth and skin-friendly softness – ideal for sensitive postpartum skin and snuggles with baby.

Made from 100% Merino wool, this nightgown naturally regulates temperature, helping you stay warm without overheating, even when uncovered during night-time feeds.

Why moms love it:
✔ Breastfeeding-friendly design – overlapping V-neck makes night feeds simple and discreet;
✔ Naturally soft and non-irritating – perfect for mom and baby’s sensitive skin;
✔ Great for pregnancy too – wider cut and stretchy material comfortably adapts to growing belly;
✔ Year-round wear – keeps you cozy in winter and cool in warmer rooms;
✔ Fabric shape recovery – gently stretches during wear and returns to form after washing.

Who it&#39;s for:
✔ Nursing moms;
✔ Expecting moms;
✔ Moms who want breathable, natural sleepwear;
✔ Women looking for comfortable and feminine wool nightgowns;
✔ You don’t have to be breastfeeding to enjoy this piece – it’s a timeless and practical nightdress for every woman.

Sizing:
Available in sizes XS to 2XL;
Cut slightly wider than standard to accommodate maternity wear. Choose your usual size or size up for an extra relaxed fit.

Material & Care:
Material: 100% Merino wool (Oeko-Tex certified, breathable, hypoallergenic).

Care instructions:
 ✓ Machine wash on wool cycle (30°C max);
 ✓ Use wool detergent only;
 ✓ Lay flat to dry;
 ✓ Do not tumble dry or bleach.

