Built for spinning. Gizzy Gator Angine De Poitrine Gator.

This high-rise mini skirt is printed all over with a Gizzy Gator and black and white polka dot pattern for a mashup between two of the greatest bands of our time -- you&#39;ll find this pattern on a number of products in my shop. The 4-way stretch fabric moves with you whether you&#39;re dancing in the pit, biking to the venue, or doing both in the same night. A 4-inch double waistband sits at the natural waist and stays put without digging in.

95% polyester, 5% spandex keeps the print vivid and the fit consistent wash after wash. Flatlock stitching keeps seams flat and comfortable against skin during long wear. Assembled in the USA.

Pair it with the matching neck gaiter or grab both -- the full set and more is listed in the King Gizzard section of my shop.
Care: Hand wash, line dry.

Fabric is very stretchy so SIZING RUNS SLIGHTLY LARGE. Size down one size from your normal size if you prefer a more snatched waist fit.


