TIME OF PROCESSING:
 This item is made to order and will be ready to ship within 1-2 weeks after payment. DELIVERY: • Standard Shipping: I use postal services for most of my orders. • Express Shipping: FedEx or DHL, depending on the country. If you have any questions - feel free to contact me.
At your special request, I can make the following adjustments: - Lengthen or shorten the overall length of the garment. If it is not possible to make the adjustments you requested, I will contact you and explain the reasons. PLEASE NOTE: Individual and personalized orders are final sales. RETURN IS IMPOSSIBLE. Individual and personalized orders are the final sale. Non refundable.
How do I return an item?
Always notify us before sending a return. Include your order number and the items you wish to return/exchange.Please always send your parcel by post, not courier. The postal service insures you for the cost of the goods as they are your responsibility until they reach us. Always keep a tracking number so we can track the parcel. We cannot accept a package that was shipped using a method other than the post office.IMPORTANT: We only make returns after we receive the package and verify that it meets our return requirements - unwashed, unworn and with a tag.IMPORTANT II: We require a tracking number to be sent after publication. We will need to track the parcel to be able to declare it to Lithuanian customs.

