HEIGHT ~ head to toe

CARE:

Wool is naturally dirt and odor resistant. When a washing or reshaping is needed, will your Woolen Moss garment shrink? 
The short answer is yes. The long answer is, with a cold wash on a gentle cycle (front loader only) and with wool wash, you can avoid heavy shrinkage and continue to enjoy your clothing for years to come. All garments should be stretched in length when wet and then laid flat to dry. If pilling occurs over time, you may use a sweater shaver as directed to maintain a clean new look.

